{
  "id": "filter.chromaKey",
  "version": 1,
  "domain": "filter",
  "inputs": 1,
  "params": {
    "color": {
      "type": "color",
      "default": [
        0,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    "similarity": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0.4,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 1
    },
    "smoothness": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0.1,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 1
    }
  },
  "color": {
    "colorSpace": "srgb-premultiplied",
    "precision": "u8"
  },
  "kernel": "chroma-key-euclidean-f64",
  "origin": "top-left",
  "alpha": "premultiplied",
  "sampling": "nearest",
  "edge": "clamp",
  "resizeMode": "same-as-input",
  "determinism": "strict",
  "capabilities": [],
  "fallback": null,
  "doc": "Un-premultiplies, then computes the RGB Euclidean distance to the key colour: distance ≤ similarity×441.67 is fully transparent, and ≤ (similarity+smoothness)×441.67 transitions linearly. 441.67 = sqrt(3)×255 is the diagonal of the RGB cube."
}
